#: ../../source/checks/plot_utils/resolve-style.md:1
msgid "_resolve_style"
msgstr "_resolve_style"

#: ../../source/checks/plot_utils/resolve-style.md:3
msgid "Firma"
msgstr "Signature"

#: ../../source/checks/plot_utils/resolve-style.md:9
msgid "Che problema risolve"
msgstr "What a problem it solves"

#: ../../source/checks/plot_utils/resolve-style.md:11
msgid ""
"Converte un nome breve di stile incluso in `mespy/stylelib` nel percorso "
"assoluto del relativo file `.mplstyle`."
msgstr ""
"Converts a short style name included in `mespy/stylelib` to the absolute "
"path of the related `.mplstyle` file."

#: ../../source/checks/plot_utils/resolve-style.md:13
msgid ""
"Questo permette a funzioni come `histogram` e `lin_fit` di accettare "
"`style=\"mespy\"`, `style=\"report\"` o `style=\"column\"` senza "
"richiedere all'utente il percorso del file di stile."
msgstr ""
"This allows functions like `histogram` and `lin_fit` to accept "
"`style=\"mespy\"`, `style=\"report\"` or `style=\"column\"` without "
"prompting the user for the path to the style file."

#: ../../source/checks/plot_utils/resolve-style.md:15
msgid "Contratto sugli input"
msgstr "Input contract"

#: ../../source/checks/plot_utils/resolve-style.md:17
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Se esiste `mespy/stylelib/{style}.mplstyle`, restituisce il path del file."
msgstr "If `mespy/stylelib/{style}.mplstyle` exists, returns the path of the file."

#: ../../source/checks/plot_utils/resolve-style.md:18
msgid ""
"Se lo stile non corrisponde a un file incluso nel package, restituisce il"
" valore ricevuto."
msgstr ""
"If the style does not match a file included in the package, returns the "
"received value."

#: ../../source/checks/plot_utils/resolve-style.md:19
msgid ""
"`style=None` resta `None`, così `_style_context` può lasciare invariati "
"gli `rcParams` correnti."
msgstr ""
"`style=None` remains `None`, so `_style_context` can leave the current "
"`rcParams` unchanged."

#: ../../source/checks/plot_utils/resolve-style.md:21
msgid "Dove viene usata"
msgstr "Where it is used"

#: ../../source/checks/plot_utils/resolve-style.md:23
msgid ""
"in [`histogram`](../../moduli/plot_utils/histogram.md), prima di entrare "
"in `_style_context`"
msgstr ""
"in [`histogram`](../../moduli/plot_utils/histogram.md), before entering "
"`_style_context`"

#: ../../source/checks/plot_utils/resolve-style.md:24
msgid ""
"in [`lin_fit`](../../moduli/fit_utils/lin-fit.md), prima di entrare in "
"`_style_context`"
msgstr ""
"in [`lin_fit`](../../moduli/fit_utils/lin-fit.md), before entering "
"`_style_context`"

#: ../../source/checks/plot_utils/resolve-style.md:26
msgid "Come fallisce"
msgstr "How it fails"

#: ../../source/checks/plot_utils/resolve-style.md:28
msgid ""
"La risoluzione e intenzionalmente permissiva: se il lookup nelle risorse "
"del package non riesce, la funzione restituisce lo stile originale. "
"L'eventuale errore viene quindi lasciato a Matplotlib quando "
"`_style_context` prova ad applicare quello stile."
msgstr ""
"The resolution is intentionally permissive: if the lookup into the "
"package resources fails, the function returns the original style. Any "
"error is then left to Matplotlib when `_style_context` tries to apply "
"that style."

#: ../../source/checks/plot_utils/resolve-style.md:30
msgid "Perche resta privata"
msgstr "Because it remains private"

#: ../../source/checks/plot_utils/resolve-style.md:32
msgid ""
"E un helper infrastrutturale del sistema di stile. Documentarlo chiarisce"
" perche gli stili bundled funzionano con nomi brevi, ma non e pensato "
"come API pubblica autonoma."
msgstr ""
"And a style system infrastructure helper. Documenting it clarifies why "
"bundled styles work with short names, but it is not intended as a "
"standalone public API."
